# Documentation Rules

After implementation, update relevant docs.

## Template repository (`astro-template`)

When maintaining this starter template, update:

- `docs/astro/*` maps (routes, screens, components, islands, i18n, performance, dependencies, rendering)
- `docs/astro/FEATURE-BASELINE.md` when Feature IDs / milestones change
- `docs/astro/DECISIONS.md` when starter ADRs change
- `docs/TEMPLATE-CHANGELOG.md` and `docs/TEMPLATE-VERSION.md` for SemVer history

Do **not** update for template-maintainer work:

- root `CHANGELOG.md` / `VERSION.md`
- `docs/system/*` (including `docs/system/CHANGELOG.md`)

Those adopting-project files are filled only in real product projects.

## Adopting projects

Required maps:

- FEATURE-REGISTRY.md
- DATA-OWNERSHIP.md
- API-CONTRACTS.md
- FLOW-MAP.md
- IMPLEMENTATION-PLAN.md
- CHANGELOG.md
- TECHNICAL-DEBT.md when needed

Frontend docs to update when relevant:

- ROUTE-MAP.md
- SCREEN-MAP.md
- COMPONENT-MAP.md
- API-USAGE.md
- I18N-MAP.md

## General

Do not document behavior that does not exist.
Mark uncertainty as Needs Review.
